This 3D Model is ready to be printed on a 3D Printer.
2 Hi-Def Models with Modules for Complete Roman Doric Pediment, Texts-Mats, Decoration. Suitable for Modern Contemporary and Ancient Architecture. Real World Scale. Architecture Serlio Block B1. STL and REVIT ready.
__________________________________________
Real World Scale Model [SmartCgArt Real World System]. Quads [C4D; OBJ; DXF] & Tris [VUE;3DS; STL].
2 STL Printable Architecture Blocks [pediment A-B] Valid Mesh Certified.
REVIT Architecture .dxf block ready.
Architecture Use: both Ancient & Modern Contemporary.
SKETCHUP Ffile is 3DS-R4.
Serlio Roman Doric Elements Series [Block B1: Pediment].
Real Technical Architecture Block from the famous Architecture Treatise by Serlio [book 4 page 143].
2 versions: with independent marble blocks and with welded parts. All with complete Classical decoration [denticles and guttae].
Modular blocks system to customize and build your own pediment with your decoration.
Complete Architecture Set ready for every type of use, Ancient or Modern Contemporary.
1- Roman Doric Order Pediment A: Modular Marble blocks and Modular Roman Doric Decoration;
2- Roman Doric Order Pediment B: Pediment parts Welded as unique block;
3- 3 statues pedestals;
4- Modular Roman Doric Decoration which can be easily removed or cloned/duplicated;
5- Modular Pediment Marble Blocks to be customized or cloned/duplicated;
6- REVIT Dxf 11 separated Blocks ready to be combined and used;
7- 2 High Quality textures for Pentelic Marble [2109x1184: Old marble and New Marble];
8- Stone Shader [580x580]
9- 4 special procedural materials for the rendering of marble [long shot and close-up], fiberglass and wood varnish [C4D, VUE];
10- 4 .txt guides: column and order scaling system, classical orders symbolism and origin, procedural materials for C4D9up, loading blocks for Revit;
11- STL 3D Ready Printable Pediment A and Pediment B [with Valid Mesh Certificate];
12- Real World Scale SmartCgArt Man Reference System with models [C4D, VUE, 3DS, OBJ, DXF].
POLYGONS/VERTICES COUNT
C4D-OBJ-DXF: only/mostly quads [148772; 135667]
VUE-3DS-STL: triangulated [269634; 135667]
All the Models are Photoreal and Hi-DEF so they are suitable also for Hi-Def Rendering and Close-Up Shots.
Enjoy THE 4 ARCHITECTS SERIES. Enjoy THE ARCHAEO.SYS SERIES.
The 4 ARCHITECTS series is developing high-fidelity materials, textures and architectural 3d blocks.
The ARCHAEO.SYS series is developing high-fidelity 3D reconstruction of Objects, Architecture and Scenes from Classical Greek and Roman Antiquity.

